{"sections":[{"slug":"高阶仿射性","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"高阶仿射性"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶仿射性</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"高阶仿射性"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">高阶仿射性是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射性</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>, $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射性大致是说一个几何对象</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Gestalt","text":"Gestalt"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">被其上某种</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴值的层</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">例如</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶拟凝聚层","text":"$n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">决定</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3>1-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射性</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">常值层</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">整体截面伴随</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于预叠</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">有一对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathrm{L}_X \\dashv \\Gamma(X,-)$,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">整体截面</span> $\\Gamma(X,-) \\colon 2\\mathsf{QCoh}(X) \\to \\mathsf{Mod}(\\mathsf{QCoh}(X))$, <span lang=\"zh\">其定义为</span>$$\r\n\\Gamma(X,F) = \\lim_{S\\in \\mathsf{Aff}_{/X}}\\Gamma(S,F),\r\n$$<span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $\\Gamma(X,F)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上自然带有</span> $\\mathsf{QCoh}(X)$-<span lang=\"zh\">模结构</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">整体截面的左伴随</span> (“<span lang=\"zh\">常值层</span>”) $\\mathrm{L}_X \\colon \\mathsf{Mod}(\\mathsf{QCoh}(X)) \\to 2\\mathsf{QCoh}(X)$, <span lang=\"zh\">其定义为</span>$$\r\n  \\Gamma(S,\\mathrm{L}_X(G)) = \\mathsf{QCoh}(S)\\otimes_{\\mathsf{QCoh}(X)} G.\r\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Gaitsgory1Affineness","text":"Gaitsgory"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> 1.3.7). <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $\\Gamma(X,-)$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $\\mathrm{L}_X$ <span lang=\"zh\">互逆</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射预叠</span>.</p>\n<h3>1-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射性</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">抽象定义</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/MontagnaniPaviaAxiomatic1Affineness","text":"Montagnani–Pavia"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">对最抽象的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/景上的层","text":"∞-<span lang=\"zh\">景上的层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">定义了</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射性</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">设有</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"∞-<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>\n$$\r\nD \\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{CAlg}(\\mathsf{Pr}^{\\mathrm{L}}),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">定义其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴化</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为如下将</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象对应到余完备范畴的函子</span>\n$$\r\nD^{\\mathrm{cat}}\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to\\mathsf{Cat}_{\\mathrm{cocomp}},\r\n$$\n$$\r\nU \\mapsto \\mathsf{Mod}(D(U)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\iota\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\widehat {\\mathcal C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为稠密嵌入</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/米田嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">米田嵌入</span>"}},{"Plain":"), <span lang=\"zh\">有两种方式将</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">的范畴化扩张至</span> $\\widehat {\\mathcal C}$:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">先将右</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张至</span> $\\widehat {\\mathcal C}$, <span lang=\"zh\">再范畴化</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">先范畴化</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">再右</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张至</span> $\\widehat {\\mathcal C}$.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这两个过程所得的函子未必相同</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但对</span> $X\\in\\widehat {\\mathcal C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">有一</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">自然比较</span></strong>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Mod}(\\operatorname{RKE}_{\\iota}D(X)) \\to \\operatorname{RKE}_{\\iota} D^{\\mathrm{cat}}(X).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">当这个比较映射为等价时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> <strong>$1$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">高阶仿射性与单子性的联系</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">高阶仿射性可以描述为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/整体截面","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">整体截面</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子性函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子性</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/StefanichHigherQCoh","text":"Stefanich"}},{"Plain":" 14.3.6, 14.3.7).\n<span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $n\\geq 2$, <span lang=\"zh\">对于预叠</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">若整体截面</span> $\\Gamma(X,-)\\colon (n+1)\\mathsf{QCoh}(X)\\to n\\mathsf{Pr}_{\\mathrm{st}}^{L}$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/单子性函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子性</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射预叠</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">称预叠的态射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射态射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是指对任意仿射概形</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的映射</span>, $X\\times_Y S$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射预叠</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/StefanichHigherQCoh","text":"Stefanich"}},{"Plain":" 14.3.8).\n<span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $n=1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的情形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称满足如下条件的预叠</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">拉回函子</span> $\\pi^*\\colon \\mathsf{Pr}^{\\mathrm{L}}_{\\mathrm{st}}= 2\\mathsf{QCoh}(\\operatorname{Spec}(\\mathbb{S})) \\to 2\\mathsf{QCoh}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子性函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子性</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的右</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>1-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射性的判定</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Gaitsgory1Affineness","text":"Gaitsgory"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">引入了</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射性的一些判定条件</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Gaitsgory1Affineness","text":"Gaitsgory"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span> 2.2.2).\n<span lang=\"zh\">对于有限型仿射代数群</span> $G$, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射叠</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">证明的大致思路是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">约化到</span> $\\mathrm{GL}_n$, <span lang=\"zh\">此时由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Gaitsgory1Affineness","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">定理</span> 6.3.7"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">仅需证明</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Gaitsgory1Affineness","text":"Gaitsgory"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span> 2.5.7).\n<span lang=\"zh\">对于线性空间</span> $V$, <span lang=\"zh\">视为</span> $\\mathsf{PreStk}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"$\\mathbb{E}_\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其高阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathbf{B}V$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射叠</span>.</li>\n<li>$\\mathbf{B}^2V$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射叠</span>.</li>\n<li>$\\mathbf{B}^3V$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射叠</span>.</li>\n<li>$\\mathbf{B}^4V$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">不是</span></strong> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">仿射叠</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}